+`AQ_SPLASH_ADOPT` -> An output found lit at startup, e.g. by a boot splash, keeps its picture until the first rendered frame if configured in the mode it was found in. Setting it vouches that whatever is lit at startup may stay on screen, a console included. Atomic modesetting only
 
